[[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3191705152","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/2512#issuecomment-3191705152","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2512","id":3191705152,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6-PY5A","user":{"login":"vladmoroz","id":8441036,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDEwMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8441036?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz","html_url":"https://github.com/vladmoroz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-15T14:59:13Z","updated_at":"2025-08-15T15:27:02Z","body":"Related, but we are doing some manual focus management and having an `<input />` that catches events which we don't have immediate access to is proving high-friction for other reasons.\n\nBefore migrating from Radix, I could just attach a data attribute to the focused element:\n\n<img width=\"449\" height=\"204\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ad3b630b-39eb-4efc-b1a1-74e8a662804e\" />\n<br />\n<br />\n\nWith Base UI, to add a data attribute I need to pull out the input from the ref and make sure to merge refs:\n\n<img width=\"640\" height=\"407\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ea30fb69-74df-4737-9340-b4e913d535ff\" />\n","a