r` prop workarounds that were enabling it.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3193494586/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3193496382","html_url":"https://github.com/mui/base-ui/issues/2512#issuecomment-3193496382","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/2512","id":3193496382,"node_id":"IC_kwDOLW-eZs6-WOM-","user":{"login":"vladmoroz","id":8441036,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0NDEwMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8441036?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz","html_url":"https://github.com/vladmoroz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vladmoroz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-16T08:27:43Z","updated_at":"2025-08-16T08:27:43Z","body":"Could Thumb render the range input without a wrapper?\n\nThe range input itself doesn't bother me, the problem is that there are two focusable elements I need to style focus on and that I don't have direct access to the range input DOM node.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mui/base-ui/issues/comments/3